          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/neural-general-circulation-models-for-modeling-precipitation-2/ >
            
              Neural general circulation models for modeling precipitation
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
