          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/beyond-clean-and-mvp-architecting-an-offline-first-reactive-data-layer-in-android-rdla/ >
            
              Beyond CLEAN and MVP: Architecting an Offline-first Reactive Data Layer in Android (RDLA)
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        Mervyn Anthony
                      
                    </div>
                
              
            
          
          
